{"title":"Career Roadmap · Casting Assistant","role":"Casting Assistant","summary":"A Casting Assistant supports casting directors and production teams in finding, organising, evaluating and coordinating actors, dancers, models and other performers for films, television, web series, theatre, advertisements, music videos and digital productions.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (General / Honours)","Course":"Dance / Theatre / Performing Arts"},"about":[{"label":"Education","text":"Undergraduate"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Casting Assistant supports casting directors and production teams in finding, organising, evaluating and coordinating actors, dancers, models and other performers for films, television, web series, theatre, advertisements, music videos and digital productions."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines performing-arts knowledge, talent research, administration, communication and production coordination."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Dance/Theatre/Performing Arts is a strongly relevant foundation, especially because it gives the student familiarity with performance, audition processes, character interpretation and the realities of working with performers."},{"type":"p","text":"However, casting is a portfolio- and network-driven industry. There is usually no single mandatory degree or licence required to become a Casting Assistant. Practical production experience and relationships with casting professionals are often more important than postgraduate qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Reality"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Direct entry after UG"},{"text":"Yes"}],[{"text":"Portfolio importance"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Industry networking"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Production experience"},{"text":"Very Important"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Administrative skills"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Acting/performance knowledge"},{"text":"Highly valuable"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Usually optional"}],[{"text":"AI impact"},{"text":"Moderate–High; mainly changes talent discovery and administration"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A Casting Assistant supports the casting process."},{"type":"p","text":"A Casting Director is a more senior professional responsible for shaping casting strategy and making/communicating major casting recommendations."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Assistant","Casting Associate","Casting Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"is a more realistic progression than expecting to become a Casting Director immediately after graduation."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Casting Assistant Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Casting Assistant may help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reading casting briefs"},{"text":"Understanding character requirements"},{"text":"Searching performer databases"},{"text":"Shortlisting actors"},{"text":"Contacting actors or talent representatives"},{"text":"Maintaining casting databases"},{"text":"Reviewing headshots and showreels"},{"text":"Organising auditions"},{"text":"Scheduling audition slots"},{"text":"Sending audition sides/scripts"},{"text":"Coordinating self-tapes"},{"text":"Maintaining audition records"},{"text":"Communicating with actors"},{"text":"Coordinating callbacks"},{"text":"Preparing casting sheets"},{"text":"Supporting casting directors during auditions"},{"text":"Organising production information"},{"text":"Maintaining confidentiality"},{"text":"Communicating with agents/managers"},{"text":"Tracking availability"},{"text":"Supporting final casting documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the production, the assistant may also help with location-based talent searches and background/extras casting."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Performing Arts Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should build strong knowledge of performance and develop professional communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting fundamentals"},{"text":"Theatre history"},{"text":"Dance/performance fundamentals"},{"text":"Character development"},{"text":"Script reading"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Stagecraft"},{"text":"Performance psychology"},{"text":"Theatre production"},{"text":"Film and television basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"People skills"},{"text":"Professional email writing"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Basic photography/video awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a:"},{"type":"h","text":"Performer Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Include fictional/sample records containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Name"},{"text":"Age range"},{"text":"Performance skills"},{"text":"Languages"},{"text":"Dance skills"},{"text":"Acting experience"},{"text":"Headshot"},{"text":"Showreel"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Special skills"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This teaches the organisational side of casting."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Learn the Casting Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand the complete journey:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Brief","Talent Search","Shortlist","Audition","Callback","Client Review","Selection"]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Character breakdowns"},{"text":"Casting briefs"},{"text":"Audition formats"},{"text":"Self-tapes"},{"text":"Callback processes"},{"text":"Screen tests"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Talent databases"},{"text":"Actor representation"},{"text":"Production schedules"},{"text":"Casting terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Airtable"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Google Drive"},{"text":"Calendar management"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Basic video editing"},{"text":"File organisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated casting call:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Cast a 10-minute short film.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Character breakdown"},{"text":"Casting notice"},{"text":"Application form"},{"text":"Performer database"},{"text":"Shortlist"},{"text":"Audition schedule"},{"text":"Self-tape instructions"},{"text":"Evaluation sheet"},{"text":"Final casting recommendation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Industry Exposure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the third year, students should start working on real productions."},{"type":"h","text":"Gain experience in"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Student films"},{"text":"Theatre productions"},{"text":"Web-series productions"},{"text":"Independent films"},{"text":"Advertisements"},{"text":"Music videos"},{"text":"Dance productions"},{"text":"Casting agencies"},{"text":"Production houses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to evaluate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting ability"},{"text":"Character suitability"},{"text":"Physical requirements"},{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Accent"},{"text":"Screen presence"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Chemistry with other performers"},{"text":"Professionalism"},{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Language skills"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to decide:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"This actor is good.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Instead, learn to determine:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Is this performer appropriate for this specific character and production?\""}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Portfolio"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Performance foundation"},{"text":"Acting, theatre, communication"},{"text":"Performer database"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Casting fundamentals"},{"text":"Briefs, auditions, scheduling"},{"text":"Simulated casting project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Industry experience"},{"text":"Talent search, auditions, production"},{"text":"2–3 production credits"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional readiness"},{"text":"Casting coordination, networking"},{"text":"Casting portfolio + credits"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a three-year BA, Year 4 activities should be incorporated into the final year."}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Performing arts"},{"text":"Acting, dance, theatre"}],[{"text":"Casting"},{"text":"Character breakdowns, talent search"}],[{"text":"Auditions"},{"text":"Scheduling, self-tapes, callbacks"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Actors, agents, directors, producers"}],[{"text":"Administration"},{"text":"Databases, spreadsheets, documentation"}],[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Scheduling, call sheets, production workflow"}],[{"text":"Digital"},{"text":"Google Workspace, Airtable, Notion"}],[{"text":"Video"},{"text":"Basic editing and file handling"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Talent discovery and background research"}],[{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"Performance and character suitability"}],[{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Talent and production relationships"}],[{"text":"Professional ethics"},{"text":"Confidentiality, fairness, consent"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are extremely important for this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Casting agencies"},{"text":"Film production houses"},{"text":"Television production companies"},{"text":"OTT/web-series production companies"},{"text":"Theatre companies"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"Talent management agencies"},{"text":"Dance companies"},{"text":"Independent filmmakers"},{"text":"Music-video production companies"},{"text":"Event and entertainment companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search for roles such as"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Casting Intern"},{"text":"Casting Assistant Intern"},{"text":"Production Intern"},{"text":"Talent Management Intern"},{"text":"Talent Coordinator"},{"text":"Production Assistant"},{"text":"Assistant Producer Intern"},{"text":"Theatre Production Intern"},{"text":"Creative Production Intern"},{"text":"Artist Management Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Don't wait for a perfect job titled \"Casting Intern.\""},{"type":"p","text":"A production-assistant or talent-coordination internship can provide equally valuable exposure."}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Short Film Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a casting plan for a fictional short film."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 characters"},{"text":"Character descriptions"},{"text":"Age requirements"},{"text":"Performance requirements"},{"text":"Language requirements"},{"text":"Casting call"},{"text":"Talent shortlist"},{"text":"Audition schedule"},{"text":"Evaluation matrix"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Actor Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a searchable database containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headshots"},{"text":"Profiles"},{"text":"Showreels"},{"text":"Skills"},{"text":"Languages"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Representation"},{"text":"Availability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Airtable / Notion / Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Self-Tape Casting Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a complete self-tape workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Call","Application","Screening","Self-Tape Request","Submission","Review","Shortlist","Callback"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Character-to-Actor Matching"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a scoring framework based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Age suitability"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Acting ability"},{"text":"Character fit"},{"text":"Appearance requirements"},{"text":"Previous experience"},{"text":"Special skills"},{"text":"Availability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The system can be implemented using Excel or Python."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Theatre Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with a college theatre group to organise actual casting."},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audition notice"},{"text":"Applications"},{"text":"Audition process"},{"text":"Shortlisting"},{"text":"Callback"},{"text":"Final cast"},{"text":"Production outcome"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides much stronger evidence than a classroom assignment."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Formal certifications are not the primary hiring factor in casting."},{"type":"p","text":"Experience and industry relationships matter more."},{"type":"p","text":"Still, useful training areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting fundamentals"},{"text":"Film appreciation"},{"text":"Theatre production"},{"text":"Film production"},{"text":"Casting processes"},{"text":"Talent management"},{"text":"Production management"},{"text":"Digital filmmaking"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Entertainment business"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful technical learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Airtable"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Premiere Pro/DaVinci Resolve"},{"text":"Basic CRM/database management"}]}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should search across casting, production and talent coordination."},{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Casting Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Casting Assistant"},{"text":"Casting Intern"},{"text":"Casting Coordinator"},{"text":"Talent Coordinator"},{"text":"Talent Management Assistant"},{"text":"Production Assistant"},{"text":"Creative Production Assistant"},{"text":"Artist Coordinator"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Assistant — Entertainment"},{"text":"Audition Coordinator"},{"text":"Theatre Production Assistant"},{"text":"Artist Relations Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Casting Associate"},{"text":"Senior Casting Associate"},{"text":"Casting Coordinator"},{"text":"Talent Manager"},{"text":"Talent Booker"},{"text":"Casting Producer"},{"text":"Associate Casting Director"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eventually:"},{"type":"h","text":"Casting Director"}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should be able to demonstrate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Casting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand a casting brief"},{"text":"Create character breakdowns"},{"text":"Find suitable performers"},{"text":"Shortlist talent"},{"text":"Organise auditions"},{"text":"Coordinate self-tapes"},{"text":"Manage callbacks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Administration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintain databases"},{"text":"Schedule auditions"},{"text":"Track submissions"},{"text":"Manage documents"},{"text":"Coordinate calendars"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional actor communication"},{"text":"Agent communication"},{"text":"Director communication"},{"text":"Producer communication"},{"text":"Confidential information handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Script understanding"},{"text":"Production schedules"},{"text":"Basic call sheets"},{"text":"Set etiquette"},{"text":"Production workflow"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not necessary for becoming a Casting Assistant."},{"type":"p","text":"However, it can be useful for moving toward production, theatre management, film or arts administration."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"table","header":["Programme","Best For"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Theatre"},{"text":"Theatre and performance"}],[{"text":"MFA Theatre/Performing Arts"},{"text":"Advanced performance"}],[{"text":"MA Film & Television"},{"text":"Film/TV industry"}],[{"text":"MA Film Production"},{"text":"Production careers"}],[{"text":"MA Media & Entertainment"},{"text":"Media industry"}],[{"text":"MA Arts Management"},{"text":"Performing arts administration"}],[{"text":"MBA Media & Entertainment"},{"text":"Business/management"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Film Production"},{"text":"Practical filmmaking"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Theatre"},{"text":"Theatre production"}],[{"text":"MA Performing Arts"},{"text":"Advanced performing arts"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical recommendation"},{"type":"p","text":"If the goal is specifically casting, 1–2 years of production/casting experience may provide more career value than immediately pursuing another degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant international programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Production"},{"text":"Casting & Performance"},{"text":"Theatre Production"},{"text":"Performing Arts Management"},{"text":"Film & Television"},{"text":"Entertainment Management"},{"text":"Arts Administration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"Germany"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Before applying, evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industry connections"},{"text":"Internship opportunities"},{"text":"Production credits available to students"},{"text":"Film/theatre ecosystem"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Work rights"},{"text":"Alumni network"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For casting specifically, industry access and practical credits are more important than the prestige of the degree alone."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A realistic pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Performing Arts Student","Production/Casting Intern","Casting Assistant","Casting Associate / Casting Coordinator","Senior Casting Associate","Casting Producer / Associate Casting Director","Casting Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Assistant","Talent Coordinator","Talent Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Assistant","Production Assistant","Production Coordinator","Producer"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Assistant","Artist Relations","Talent Acquisition/Booking","Talent Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Opportunities","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Film & OTT Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feature films"},{"text":"Web series"},{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Character actors"},{"text":"Supporting roles"},{"text":"Lead casting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Screen acting"},{"text":"Screen presence"},{"text":"Self-tapes"},{"text":"Chemistry tests"},{"text":"Screen tests"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B. Commercial/Advertising Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TV commercials"},{"text":"Digital advertisements"},{"text":"Brand campaigns"},{"text":"Models"},{"text":"Actors"},{"text":"Influencers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brief interpretation"},{"text":"Fast talent sourcing"},{"text":"Client requirements"},{"text":"Appearance/skill matching"},{"text":"Scheduling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C. Theatre Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stage actors"},{"text":"Theatre productions"},{"text":"Musicals"},{"text":"Experimental theatre"},{"text":"Dance productions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Theatre history"},{"text":"Stage performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"is particularly useful."},{"type":"h","text":"D. Talent Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of casting for individual productions, manage performers."},{"type":"p","text":"Work can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artist profiles"},{"text":"Opportunities"},{"text":"Auditions"},{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Brand partnerships"},{"text":"Career development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E. Dance & Performing Arts Casting"},{"type":"p","text":"For students with strong dance backgrounds, specialise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dance productions"},{"text":"Music videos"},{"text":"Stage shows"},{"text":"Live events"},{"text":"Commercial campaigns"},{"text":"Musical theatre"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dance styles"},{"text":"Choreography"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Performance levels"}]},{"type":"p","text":"can become a competitive advantage."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Casting — 2030–2045","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly change how casting teams discover and organise talent."},{"type":"h","text":"AI may assist with"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Talent database search"},{"text":"Profile matching"},{"text":"Self-tape transcription"},{"text":"Video tagging"},{"text":"Audition scheduling"},{"text":"Talent recommendations"},{"text":"Availability matching"},{"text":"Language/accent analysis"},{"text":"Database management"},{"text":"Contract/document workflows"},{"text":"Production scheduling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future workflow could look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting Brief","AI-assisted Talent Search","Human Review","Self-Tape Request","Audition","Director/Casting Team Evaluation","Final Selection"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important ethical issues"},{"type":"p","text":"Casting professionals must be careful about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Facial recognition"},{"text":"Biometric data"},{"text":"Algorithmic bias"},{"text":"Unauthorised use of performers' likenesses"},{"text":"AI-generated replicas/deepfakes"},{"text":"Fair representation"},{"text":"Transparent evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should therefore be treated as a support tool rather than an automatic replacement for casting judgement."}]},{"heading":"Future-Proof Skill Combination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Performing Arts","Casting","Production Coordination","Talent Database Management","Digital Tools","AI Literacy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly valuable combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Casting","Talent Management","Production","Data/Database Skills"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the professional to work across several areas of entertainment."}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Requirements","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Unlike many conventional careers, casting is heavily influenced by proof of practical work."},{"type":"p","text":"Build a portfolio containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Casting briefs"},{"type":"p","text":"3–5 sample character breakdowns."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Talent database"},{"type":"p","text":"A properly organised sample database."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Casting projects"},{"type":"p","text":"At least 3–5 projects showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirement"},{"text":"Talent search"},{"text":"Shortlisting"},{"text":"Auditions"},{"text":"Final selection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Production credits"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to obtain real credits from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Theatre"},{"text":"Web series"},{"text":"Advertisements"},{"text":"Student productions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Recommendation/contact network"},{"type":"p","text":"Build professional relationships with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Actors"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Producers"},{"text":"Theatre groups"},{"text":"Production assistants"},{"text":"Talent managers"},{"text":"Casting professionals"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA Performing Arts graduate can also pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Actor"},{"text":"Theatre Artist"},{"text":"Casting Assistant"},{"text":"Casting Associate"},{"text":"Casting Director"},{"text":"Talent Manager"},{"text":"Artist Coordinator"},{"text":"Production Assistant"},{"text":"Production Coordinator"},{"text":"Assistant Producer"},{"text":"Theatre Producer"},{"text":"Stage Manager"},{"text":"Choreographer"},{"text":"Dance Instructor"},{"text":"Creative Producer"},{"text":"Artist Relations Executive"},{"text":"Entertainment Coordinator"},{"text":"Talent Booker"},{"text":"Film Researcher"},{"text":"Script/Development Assistant"},{"text":"Arts Administrator"},{"text":"Entertainment Marketing Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Performing arts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting/theatre knowledge"},{"text":"Character interpretation"},{"text":"Performance awareness"},{"text":"Script reading"},{"text":"Understanding of performers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Casting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Casting briefs"},{"text":"Talent search"},{"text":"Shortlisting"},{"text":"Audition coordination"},{"text":"Self-tape management"},{"text":"Callback coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production workflow"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Set etiquette"},{"text":"Basic production terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel/Google Sheets"},{"text":"Airtable/Notion"},{"text":"Google Drive"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Basic video editing"},{"text":"Database management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Organisation"},{"text":"Negotiation basics"},{"text":"Deadline management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2+ internships"},{"text":"3–5 casting/production projects"},{"text":"2–3 production credits"},{"text":"A structured talent database"},{"text":"Professional industry contacts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Performing Arts / Theatre / Dance","Year 1: Acting + theatre + performance + communication","Year 2: Casting fundamentals + audition processes + databases","Learn Excel + Airtable/Notion + production coordination","Year 3: Work on student films/theatre/independent productions","Complete casting/production internships","Build casting portfolio + real production credits","Casting Intern / Production Assistant / Talent Coordinator","Casting Assistant","Casting Associate / Casting Coordinator","Senior Casting Associate","Associate Casting Director / Casting Producer","Casting Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Performing Arts","Casting Expertise","Production Experience","Talent Networking","Database/Organisation Skills","Digital Tools","AI/Entertainment-Tech Awareness"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, real production credits and industry relationships should be prioritised over collecting many certificates. A student who graduates with a strong casting portfolio, practical credits and a network of actors/directors/producers can be significantly more employable than someone with only the BA qualification."}]}]}